@kelearns/dsh-build-diff README · 工作原理：- 存储：`$DSH_HOME/build-diff/{config.json,index.json,loops/<id>.json}`；超过 `retentionDays`（默认 7 天，保留最近 200 条）自动清理。
- 快照成本：全文件指纹 + 文本文件（≤ `contentCapBytes`，默认 1 MB，单轮总预算 256 MB）内容捕获；内存缓存按（路径, size, mtime）命中，未变工作区后续轮次近似零 IO。
- 默认排除：`.git`、`node_modules`、`dist`、`build`、`target`、`out`、`coverage`、`.next`、`.venv`、`__pycache__`、`.idea`、`.vscode` 等（见 `lib/engine.js`）。

@kelearns/dsh-build-diff README · How it works：- Storage: `$DSH_HOME/build-diff/{config.json,index.json,loops/<id>.json}`; loops expire after `retentionDays` (default 7, keep last 200).
- Snapshot cost: fingerprints for every file + contents of text files ≤ `contentCapBytes` (default 1 MB, total budget 256 MB per loop), with an in-memory (path, size, mtime) content cache so unchanged workspaces cost ~zero I/O on later loops.
- Excluded by default: `.git`, `node_modules`, `dist`, `build`, `target`, `out`, `coverage`, `.next`, `.venv`, `__pycache__`, `.idea`, `.vscode`, … (see `lib/engine.js`).
